<title>USA: Media General completes purchase of papers.</title>
<headline>Media General completes purchase of papers.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media General said it has completed its purchase of The Reidsville Review, a five-day evening and Sunday newspaper, and two other publications from Rockingham Newspapers Inc for approximately $4 million.</p>
</text>
